\label{lem:holspc}
Let $F\subset M$ be a compact special Lagrangian submanifold for
$(J,\omega_J,\Omega_J)$ with phase $\theta$. Then the following are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}
\item $F$ is $I$-holomorphic Lagrangian;
\item $[\omega_K|_F]=0$ in $H^2(F, \mathbb R)$;
\item $\int_F (\omega_{K}+i \omega_{I})^n = i^n \int_F \omega^n_I$.
\end{enumerate}
